test metal_info_parses_xcodebuild_json {
    metal_info must return the fields of `xcodebuild -json
    -showComponent MetalToolchain` (parsed via plist_value's "data"
    source form -- proven able to handle this exact JSON shape by
    plist_value_reads_json_from_data_source above), plus the build_train
    derived from buildVersion.
